"},{"title":"What V.F. (VFC) Said on Its Q2 Earnings Call","src":"TradingView","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPeld4R3lQUDhUTmEwSFBRZHd6bEFkVzN3R3BjMEFpWVZNYzE5WDFfcE5vb25CRmdTVXV4X3JibUJJZDN3M0tSQWc2VlVlNnNzRnRKYTczbHNKTEJ2R1JaeUFmMllESEJoM29hSVBMT2hIQmpGWmcxM3VxS0JuWG5OcUlTaE5LeHBvTmYzSGZEWTZXOXNyeUJzcUFRQnJPanAtQ1kwZA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":""},{"title":"'Deeply regressive': How the French government plans to make protesters pay for riots and looting","src":"France 24","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":""},{"title":"Ralph Lauren Poised to Deliver Fiscal Q2 Beat, Raise Earnings Guidance, UBS Securities Says","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOUnFyUVhqVlhabGNybi1Pb3k5NjZuY1h3LUF2c2RXRkREdV9sX0o5NFdZdHZqSzRPd2xweC1VY1JJZVVXLXE5XzlGbkNrMlhPbEdVZm00QjBlLWpUc29NYm1fc1FWZFl0OWVWUFZvMVJ3eVo3ZDJIbGoteWJlcnF6UHVIdkFPbUVoSW1aRGRsdXpOWGUyblBNWDlNMXBQRnVj?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":""},{"title":"Ralph Lauren Poised to Deliver Fiscal Q2 Beat, Raise Earnings Guidance, UBS Securities Says","src":"marketscreener.com","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":""}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":7},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-05-21","period":"2026-03-28","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1037038/000162828026037074/rl-20260328.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Founded in 1967 by Mr. Ralph Lauren, we are a global leader in the design, marketing, and distribution of luxury lifestyle products, including apparel, handbags, footwear & accessories, fragrances, home, and hospitality. For nearly 60 years, Ralph Lauren has sought to inspire the dream of a better life through authenticity and timeless style. Our long-standing reputation and distinctive image have been developed across a wide range of products, brands, distribution channels, and international markets. We believe that our global reach, breadth of lifestyle product offerings, and multi-channel distribution network are unique among luxury and apparel companies.","zh":"我們由 Ralph Lauren 先生於 1967 年創立，是奢華生活方式產品設計、行銷和分銷的全球領導者，產品包括服裝、手袋、鞋類和配件、香水、家居和酒店用品。近 60 年來，Ralph Lauren 一直致力於透過真實性和永恆的風格激發人們對美好生活的夢想。我們在廣泛的產品、品牌、分銷管道和國際市場中建立了長期的聲譽和獨特的形象。我們相信，我們的全球影響力、生活方式產品的廣泛性以及多通路分銷網路在奢侈品和服裝公司中是獨一無二的。"},{"en":"We diversify our business by geography (North America, Europe, and Asia, among other regions) and channel of distribution (retail, wholesale, and licensing). This allows us to maintain a dynamic balance as our operating results do not depend solely on the performance of any single geographic area or channel of distribution. We sell directly to consumers through our integrated retail channel, which includes our retail stores, concession-based shop-within-shops, and digital commerce operations around the world. Our wholesale sales are made principally to major department stores, specialty stores, and third-party digital partners around the world, as well as to certain third-party-owned stores to which we have licensed the right to operate in defined geographic territories using our trademarks. In addition, we license to third parties for specified periods and geographies the right to acces","zh":"我們根據地理位置（北美、歐洲和亞洲等地區）和分銷管道（零售、批發和授權）實現業務多元化。這使我們能夠保持動態平衡，因為我們的經營業績不僅取決於任何單一地理區域或分銷管道的表現。我們透過綜合零售通路直接向消費者銷售產品，其中包括我們的零售店、特許經營店中店以及世界各地的數位商務營運。我們的批發銷售主要面向世界各地的主要百貨公司、專賣店和第三方數位合作夥伴，以及我們已授權使用我們的商標在特定地理區域經營的某些第三方擁有的商店。此外，我們也向第三方授予在指定期間和地區存取權限的許可"},{"en":"We organize our business into the following three reportable segments: North America, Europe, and Asia. In addition to these reportable segments, we also have other non-reportable segments. See \"Our Segments\" for further discussion of our segment reporting structure.","zh":"我們將業務分為以下三個可報告部分：北美、歐洲和亞洲。除了這些可報告分部外，我們還有其他非報告分部。有關我們分部報告結構的進一步討論，請參閱「我們的分部」。"}],"markets":[{"en":"North America — Our North America segment, representing approximately 41% of our Fiscal 2026 net revenues, primarily consists of sales of our Ralph Lauren branded apparel, handbags, footwear & accessories, home, and related products made through our retail and wholesale businesses primarily in the U.S. and Canada. In North America, our retail business is primarily comprised of our Ralph Lauren stores, our outlet stores, and our digital commerce sites, www.RalphLauren.com and www.RalphLauren.ca. Our wholesale business in North America is comprised primarily of sales to department stores and, to a lesser extent, specialty stores.","zh":"北美—我們的北美部門約占我們 2026 財年淨收入的 41%，主要包括透過我們主要在美國和加拿大的零售和批發業務生產的 Ralph Lauren 品牌服裝、手袋、鞋類和配件、家居及相關產品的銷售。在北美，我們的零售業務主要包括 Ralph Lauren 商店、直銷店以及數位商務網站 www.RalphLauren.com 和 www.RalphLauren.ca。我們在北美的批發業務主要包括向百貨公司銷售，其次是專賣店。"},{"en":"Europe — Our Europe segment, representing approximately 31% of our Fiscal 2026 net revenues, primarily consists of sales of our Ralph Lauren branded apparel, handbags, footwear & accessories, home, and related products made through our retail and wholesale businesses in Europe and emerging markets. In Europe, our retail business is primarily comprised of our Ralph Lauren stores, our outlet stores, our concession-based shop-within-shops, and our various digital commerce sites. Our wholesale business in Europe is comprised primarily of a","zh":"歐洲—我們的歐洲部門約占我們 2026 財年淨收入的 31%，主要包括透過我們在歐洲和新興市場的零售和批發業務生產的 Ralph Lauren 品牌服裝、手袋、鞋類和配件、家居以及相關產品的銷售。在歐洲，我們的零售業務主要包括 Ralph Lauren 商店、直銷店、特許經營店中店以及各種數位商務網站。我們在歐洲的批發業務主要包括"}],"customers":[{"en":"We have three key wholesale customers that generate significant sales volume. During Fiscal 2026, sales to our three largest wholesale customers accounted for approximately 11% of our total net revenues. Approximately 70% of sales to our three largest wholesale customers related to our North America segment and approximately 30% related to our Europe segment.","zh":"我們擁有三個產生大量銷售的主要批發客戶。 2026 財年，我們三大批發客戶的銷售額約占我們總淨收入的 11%。我們向三大批發客戶銷售的約 70% 與我們的北美部門有關，約 30% 與我們的歐洲部門有關。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Competition is very strong in the segments of the fashion and consumer product industries in which we operate. We compete with an extensive range of designers and manufacturers of apparel, handbags, footwear, accessories, fragrances, and home products, both domestic and international. We also face increasing competition from companies selling our product categories solely through the Internet. Some of our competitors may be significantly larger and have substantially greater resources than us. We compete primarily on the basis of brand strength, timeless style, quality, value, and service, which depend on our ability to:","zh":"我們經營的時尚和消費品產業領域的競爭非常激烈。我們與國內外眾多服裝、手袋、鞋類、配件、香水和家居產品的設計師和製造商競爭。我們還面臨來自僅透過網路銷售我們產品類別的公司的日益激烈的競爭。我們的一些競爭對手可能比我們規模大得多，擁有更多的資源。我們的競爭主要基於品牌實力、永恆的風格、品質、價值和服務，這取決於我們的能力："},{"en":"anticipate and respond in a timely manner to changing consumer demands and shopping preferences, including the ever-increasing shift to digital brand engagement, social media communications, and online and cross-channel shopping;","zh":"預測並及時回應不斷變化的消費者需求和購物偏好，包括不斷增加的數位品牌參與度、社交媒體傳播以及線上和跨通路購物；"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-03-28","items":[{"name":"North America","val":3329600000,"zh":"北美洲部門"},{"name":"Europe","val":2538900000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia","val":2103500000,"zh":"亞洲分部"},{"name":"Other Non Reportable Segment Related","val":142500000,"zh":"其他與不可報告分部相關的"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":142500000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":8114500000},"geo":{"end":"2026-03-28","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":3495100000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"US","val":3304000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Europe","val":2515800000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Asia","val":2103600000,"zh":"亞洲"}],"total":8114500000}},"peers":["PVH","TPR","VFC","ROST","ANF"]}}